comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T17:33:00.440Z",codex-astra,"Main 0b3d5a3 retains the unguarded NativeWriteFence dispatch identified in the November 5 issue comment. Reusing pm-ado-sdk-history-fence for implementation; this roadmap remains partially delivered and the PR will use Refs #47. Scope: bind locked SDK revision guards to the decision document, retain native history and forward-only recovery, test ordinary OS-process writers in the final-read/write interval, and create Feature acceptance items for remaining backend contracts and conformance. Repository SDK stays pinned at 2026.11.4; registry currently reports 2026.11.6. Storage-override corrections after the pin require explicit scope and capability treatment."
  "2026-11-06T17:46:47.263Z",codex-astra,"Remaining roadmap split into three open Feature children with acceptance criteria: pm-ado-backend-contract (backend-bound authority, preview, audit/intents and distributed recovery), pm-ado-monotonic-write-guard (locked monotonic history plus corrected storage-override certification), pm-ado-backend-conformance (filesystem/native database, two writers, stale revisions, replay, authorization and relation fidelity). The shared public ExpectedItemRevision contract has id/itemHash only; no expected history coordinate. Existing source/build forward-only, birth, lifecycle and ABA controls pass. Linked PM test execution passes 80/80 with no skips. Typecheck, build:test and docstrings (19 files/128 declarations) pass; there is no lint script. Clean CI-identity strict health passes with a telemetry advisory; normal local identity sees an unrelated pm-github host-version-skew finding. No telemetry or extension configuration was changed."
  "2026-11-06T17:55:48.369Z",codex-astra,"Linked targeted Azure acceptance passes 18/18, no skips: first import, stale 412 refusal with item/history preservation, typed relation round trip, eight recovery scenarios (lease expiry, local write failure, ambiguous success, context/intent changes, two writers, peer settlement, local-only settlement), close-assignment recovery, and source/built native policy-hook refusal. Full release/coverage gates remain assigned to CI under the task instruction; no threshold was changed. Function-only revert and late-read mutation proofs are recorded in the implementation owner."
  "2026-11-06T17:59:52.181Z",codex-astra,"PR preparation: decision-bound guard source/built regressions pass 23/23 after function-only and late-read mutation proofs; linked suites pass 80/80 and 18/18. The real 2026.10.25 legacy-host control passes successful writes, validation and stale-history refusal; remaining packed global-runtime controls are still running. Full npm/Bun and Node22/26 release gates will run in CI at unchanged thresholds. Scope remains Refs #47 with three explicit Feature follow-ups; no native database or monotonic final-interval isolation claim."
  "2026-11-06T18:05:29.444Z",codex-astra,"PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/pull/92 is open at implementation 9a6665e15f387d03ba81a4d772181e45688a8d1c and queued for CodeRabbit. Initial CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/42266895169 and CodeQL https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/42266895229 are queued, not verified. Selected packed acceptance passes 7/7: the real SDK2026.10.25 compatibility control plus five global-runtime scenarios (npm-global, Bun-global, npx, bunx and project-local). The six project-local launcher scenarios were filtered from this focused run and remain in the unchanged full CI matrix. No provider credentials or live provider calls were used. Greptile reports an expired trial and has supplied no review evidence."
  "2026-11-06T18:08:13.927Z",codex-astra,"Local acceptance is complete for the bounded native revision-guard slice: fixed-clock matrix19/19, linked fence/adoption80/80, Azure recovery/relation18/18, restored new regressions23/23, selected packed7/7. Six project-local packed cases remain reserved for full CI. PR92 uses Refs #47 and links all five touched items. The three Feature children retain the remaining backend contract, locked monotonic audit-coordinate/storage-override and database conformance acceptance. This final tracker receipt will receive a fresh exact-head CI/review pass; final external statuses and any unavailable checks are recorded in the PR and final report. No item is closed; releasing this author claim."
